{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>They Left Us Here</strong>&quot; is a Sci-Fi Horror Game  where you explore an abandoned Space Station  escaping roaming horrors ready to terminate while you\u00a0search for your identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken with no memories, no instructions, and no escape in sight. The crew is gone. The halls are empty. Only flickering lights and locked doors remain. As you search for answers, you uncover cryptic puzzles, broken systems, and fragments of the past that hint at a truth you were never meant to discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wake up. Find answers. Escape \u2014 if you can</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way through a mazelike abandoned space station</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004830/extras/387c2b70d02eca2394eb52ba833709a7.poster.avif?t=1768310193\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004830/extras/387c2b70d02eca2394eb52ba833709a7.webm?t=1768310193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004830/extras/387c2b70d02eca2394eb52ba833709a7.mp4?t=1768310193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues, keycards, and tools. Escaping the space station won\u2019t be easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004830/extras/b09ddd5444f54831f48a264c633497ce.poster.avif?t=1768310193\" width=800 hei